stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UsuarioEXEC
    UsuarioEXEC --> PrivilegiadoEXEC: enable
    PrivilegiadoEXEC --> UsuarioEXEC: disable
    PrivilegiadoEXEC --> ConfigGlobal: configure terminal
    ConfigGlobal --> PrivilegiadoEXEC: exit / end / Ctrl+Z
    ConfigGlobal --> ConfigLinha: line console 0 / line vty 0 15
    ConfigGlobal --> ConfigInterface: interface <nome>
    ConfigLinha --> ConfigGlobal: exit
    ConfigInterface --> ConfigGlobal: exit
    ConfigLinha --> PrivilegiadoEXEC: end / Ctrl+Z
    ConfigInterface --> PrivilegiadoEXEC: end / Ctrl+Z
